     "model": {
      "question": "Your friend is coming to stay for a weekend and asks what you could do together. · Points: say you're happy · suggest two plans · ask about food",
      "paras": [
       "{Hi} Lucy,",
       "{Thanks for your email — it was great to hear from you!} I'm so excited that you're finally coming to Madeira next month.",
       "{You asked me about} what we could do together. {Well,} on Saturday morning we could walk along the levada near my house. The views over the valley are amazing, and it isn't too difficult, so don't worry. In the evening, there's a music festival in the old town, and some of my friends are playing in a band.",
       "{As for} food, is there anything you don't eat? My mum wants to make her famous fish stew, but she's happy to cook something else if you'd prefer. {If I were you, I'd} bring a warm jacket too, because it gets surprisingly cold in the mountains. {Why don't we} go to the beach on Sunday if the weather is good?",
       "{Anyway, I'd better go now. Write back soon!}",
       "{Love,} Rita"
      ]
     }
